# ============================================================
# Cloud-API-2  —  方案 A（完整分发）
# 预编译库(.a/.so/.dylib)与 gradle-wrapper.jar 均纳入版本管理，
# 仅忽略真正的构建产物、本地垃圾与打包临时文件。
# ============================================================

# --- Compiled objects / class files（构建产物，忽略） ---
*.class
*.o
*.obj

# --- Logs ---
*.log

# --- BlueJ / J2ME ---
*.ctxt
.mtj.tmp/

# --- Archive / packaging artifacts（make_source_package.sh 等打包产物，忽略） ---
# 注意：方案 A 保留 *.jar / *.so / *.a / *.dylib，不在此忽略
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.rar
*.7z

# --- Build output directories（CMake / Maven / Gradle，忽略） ---
build/
out/
target/
cmake-build-*/
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
.gradle/

# --- IDE / editor ---
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- JVM crash logs ---
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
